  {
   "case": "Bull",
   "probability": "18%",
   "driver": "The v4 lands at or below $33,000 on independent quotes, 2027 contracts clear $12,700 with some at the $16,500 list, an independent measure holds bruising under 2.5%, 360 robots are in service by April 2027 and the 100-robot licence test is met with USMCA origin certified at 0% duty.",
   "evidence": "The contribution matrix turns positive at $16,500 with a $31,000-33,000 build ($3,150-2,650 a season) [S1]; four growers already contracted 110 robots at the renewal price [S1]; 2028 revenue of $13.2M at 5-7x forward supports a $66-92M mark [S95].",
   "outcome": "A 2029-2031 trade sale to Deere, CNH or Kubota at about $250M: $33.3M to the $12M lead, 2.8x (2.2x after a 20% Series B dilution).",
   "implication": "Lead the round, hold through the 2028 Series B and sell to an OEM buying the perception model and grower base."
  },
  {
   "case": "Base",
